our interests, helping to destroy Ukraine,\u201d he said. However, the most robust reaction from the assembly came in the statement from Slovak MEP Miroslav Rada\u010dovsk\u00fd. \u201cWe should stop supplying weapons to Ukraine, stop supporting the killing of Slavs. Because if we don\u2019t stop, we, Slavs, will unite as brothers \u2014 and I believe we will unite \u2014 and level Western Europe to the ground. I\u2019m sure no one here wants that,\u201d the politician said. He noted that the EU currently has no chance of winning against Russia and called the Ukrainian conflict a \u201cUS problem.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe must start peace negotiations, but without Americans, and stop these killings,\u201d he added.", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Membership", "roles": [], "idxs": [8, 8], "activation": "Members"}, {"name": "Intentionally_act", "roles": [{"name": "Agent", "filler": "Members of the European Parliament ( EP )", "idxs": [8, 15]}, {"name": "Time", "filler": "during debates on the need for further support to Ukraine", "idxs": [20, 29]}, {"name": "Act", "filler": "in mutual insults", "idxs": [17, 19]}], "idxs": [16, 16], "activation": "engaged"}, {"name": "Membership", "roles": [{"name": "Member", "filler": "members", "idxs": [2, 2]}, {"name": "Group", "filler": "European Parliament", "idxs": [0, 1]}], "idxs": [2, 2], "activation": "members"}, {"name": "Taking_sides", "roles": [{"name": "Side", "filler": "for Ukraine", "idxs": [6, 7]}], "idxs": [5, 5], "activation": "support"}, {"name": "Increment", "roles": [{"name": "Class", "filler": "support to Ukraine", "idxs": [27, 29]}], "idxs": [26, 26], "activation": "further"}, {"name": "Quarreling", "roles": [{"name": "Arguers", "filler": "European Parliament members", "idxs": [0, 2]}, {"name": "Issue", "filler": "over support for Ukraine Members of the European Parliament ( EP ) engaged in mutual insults during debates on the need for further support to Ukraine", "idxs": [4, 2